  "description": "HTML-in-markdown rendering extension for MarkdownWPF. Adds support for HTML tags <table>, <ul>/<ol>, <img>, <a>, and inline formatting (<b>, <i>, <u>, <s>, <code>) inside Markdown documents rendered by MarkdownWPF.",
